**glyph.cpp selects controller glyph families and resolves key glyph names.**

## API

- `glyph_family_for(controller::family, optional<glyph_family>) noexcept -> glyph_family`: override wins; DualShock/DualSense map to `playstation`, Xbox/unknown to `xbox`.
- `glyph_for(engine_key, glyph_family) noexcept -> const char*`: delegates to `key_name`; family is ignored.